& [P2S04CompletionReviewV1] is the completion review for P2-S04 storage posture and projection boundary decision
  + [slice_id] is P2-S04
  + [slice_name] is storage posture and projection boundary decision
  + [model_route_used] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [model_route_depth] is deeper_reasoning_required
  + [review_result] is accepted
  + [accepted_output] is docs/decisions/P2_Storage_Posture_And_Projection_Boundary_Decision.v1.sop
  + [accepted_output_sha256] is 74319F4ABB2FCF8C707168B1C3BD776F4532EB38D68C115AB6E90A1E7D16ACE6
  + [next_gate_result] is P2-S05 may open
  + [P2-S05_model_route] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable only if bounded to fixture and validation oracle planning without fixture file creation or implementation
  + [P2-S05_model_route_reason] is fixture planning is bounded after schema, record-kind, natural-key, and storage posture decisions are accepted
  + [storage_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [dependency_installation_authorized] is false
  + [package_metadata_mutation_authorized] is false
  + [generated_database_creation_authorized] is false
  + [adapter_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [operations_control_authorized] is false
  + [live_machine_control_authorized] is false

  = must: treat this review as acceptance of a storage posture, not acceptance of storage implementation
  = must: open only P2-S05 fixture and validation oracle planning
  = must: keep storage implementation, fixture source creation, expected ledger creation, dependencies, adapters, dispatch, operations control, and live machine control gated

& [VerificationAgainstSlice: P2-S04] is the verification result for the P2-S04 slice contract
  + [expected_output_present] is true
  + [expected_output_hash] is 74319F4ABB2FCF8C707168B1C3BD776F4532EB38D68C115AB6E90A1E7D16ACE6
  + [source_authority_distinguished] is true
  + [canonical_authority_distinguished] is true
