  ! [P2S04SliceContractSatisfied] is accepted
    @ [support] docs/decisions/P2_Storage_Posture_And_Projection_Boundary_Decision.v1.sop

& [SupportDelta: P2-S04] is the support delta created by the accepted storage posture decision
  + [support_added] is source authority remains Git-tracked SOP/canonical/review authority and can be inspected without database runtime
  + [support_added] is future kernel record persistence must preserve overlay fields, natural keys, source refs, lineage refs, review gates, invalidation refs, and content hashes
  + [support_added] is SQLite, JSONL, LangGraph checkpoints, surface state, mailbox carrier state, generated reports, and dry-run outputs are rebuildable or trace-only non-authority unless future authority says otherwise
  + [support_added] is P2-S05 fixture planning must cover storage-projection nonpromotion and false-ready projection cases
  + [support_gap_closed] is storage posture remains undecided for truth-bearing kernel records
  + [support_gap_remaining] is no physical storage implementation is authorized
  + [support_gap_remaining] is no dependency or package metadata change is authorized
  + [support_gap_remaining] is no generated database, fixture source, expected ledger, adapter, dispatch, operations-control, or live-control work is authorized

& [RequirementDelta: P2-S04] is the requirement delta after storage posture acceptance
  + [requirement_added] is downstream fixtures must distinguish authority records from projection-only records
  + [requirement_added] is future storage implementation must route through source-preserved activation and nonpromotion proof
  + [requirement_added] is projection freshness must derive from source hash sets, projection build rules, and latest basis changes
  + [requirement_added] is future storage candidates must fail closed when required source authority is missing or unresolved
  + [requirement_preserved] is source specification preservation contract
  + [requirement_preserved] is P2 overlay authority_class effect_boundary currentness_state review_gate_ref and invalidation_ref_set
  + [requirement_preserved] is dispatch operations-control and live-control gates remain closed

