& [DownstreamReadinessAfterP2S04] is the downstream readiness result after P2-S04
  + [P2-S05] is ready_for_execution
  + [P2-S05_name] is fixture and validation oracle plan
  + [P2-S05_model_route] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable only if bounded to fixture and validation oracle planning without fixture file creation or implementation
  + [P2-S05_model_route_reason] is fixture planning is bounded after schema, record-kind, natural-key, and storage posture decisions are accepted
  + [P2-S06] is gated_until_P2-S05_accepted
  + [P3] is gated_until_P2_completion_or_explicit_rebake
